  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLXQT-51" textLabel="NAD+-dependent isocitrate dehydrogenase" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLXQT-51" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="450" centerY="535" width="230" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>The mitochondrially-localized NAD+-dependent isocitrate dehydrogenase is a heteromeric complex in all species studied to date including yeast (&lt;i&gt;S.cerevisiae&lt;/i&gt;), cows, pigs, tobacco &lt;i&gt;Nicotiana tabacum&lt;/i&gt;, and Arabidopsis, though the subunit composition and stoichiometry of the complexes seem to differ between species |CITS: [2198251][16527867][7287723][4319243][9881153]|. The Arabidopsis complex appears to be similar to the yeast complex composed of IDH1 and IDH2 where one catalytic and one regulatory are required for activity |CITS: [2198251][16527867][9881153]|. Arabidopsis has three regulatory subunits (|FRAME: AT4G35260|, |FRAME: AT2G17130|, and |FRAME: AT4G35650|) plus two catalytic subunits (|FRAME: AT5G03290| and |FRAME: AT3G09810|). Any of the six potential dimeric combinations of a regulatory and catalytic subunit can functionally complement the yeast &lt;i&gt;idh1 idh2&lt;/i&gt; double mutant, whereas none of the subunits alone have been shown to complement the double mutant |CITS: [16527867]|. The representative |FRAME: AT2G17130| / |FRAME: AT5G03290| complex shown here contains two of the best-characterized subunits. The exact stoichiometry of the subunits in the complex is unknown and it remains possible that multimeric complexes containing one or more different catalytic and regulatory subunits together may also form &lt;i&gt;in planta&lt;/i&gt; as suggested for tobacco |CITS: [16527867][9881153]|. This enzyme complex is believed to function in the |FRAME: PWY-5690 TCA cycle| and may participate in nitrogen assimilation pathways as well |CITS: [16527867][17468208]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLXQT-51" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT5G03290-MONOMER, AT2G17130-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="ComponentCount" value="2" />
      <Property key="IsComplex" value="true" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-12840" />
      <Property key="GOTerms" value="GO:0005739" />
      <Property key="^citations" value="14671022" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="CPLX-*" />
      <Property key="Locations" value="CCI-MIT-PL" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_16527867" />
    </Group>
  </Groups>
